    {
      "regex": "(?i)^\\s*¡?\\s*(?:hola|buenas|qu[eé] tal|hey|bienvenid[oa]s?|qu[eé] pasa)\\b",
      "message": "Greeting (\"Hola chicos\"). Nobody came to the feed to be greeted."
